.TH RUSTMIUS 1 "2026" "rustmius @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rustmius \- fast, native, open-source SSH client and host manager for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rustmius
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Rustmius
is a modern, fast, and local-first alternative to Termius, built in pure Rust
with egui/eframe, russh, and alacritty_terminal. It provides an integrated SSH
terminal, a host manager with ~/.ssh/config discovery, and optional E2E
encrypted GitHub Gist vault synchronization.
.PP
Rustmius is a graphical application and takes no command-line arguments; run
it from your application launcher or from a terminal.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Controls log verbosity (e.g. \fBinfo\fR, \fBdebug\fR) via tracing-subscriber.
.SH FILES
Configuration and secrets are stored locally in the user's standard
configuration directory and the system keyring.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/Cleboost/Rustmius
.SH AUTHOR
Cleboost and the Rustmius contributors.
